:null,"note":null,"sourceText":"125 g de calabacín"},{"ingredientId":"tomate-cherry","quantity":6,"unit":"ud","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"6 tomates Cherry"},{"ingredientId":"tomate-triturado","quantity":75,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"75 g de tomate triturado"}],"steps":[{"text":{"es":"Ponemos las verduras troceadas en una bandeja, echamos el ajo y la cebolla en polvo, una pizca de sal y un poco de aceite en spray, removemos e introducimos en la Cecofry, programamos 180ºC durante 15 minutos.","en":"Put the chopped vegetables on a tray, add the garlic and onion powder, a pinch of salt and a little spray oil, toss, and put into the Cecofry, then set to 180 °C for 15 minutes."},"timerMinutes":15,"temperatureC":180},{"text":{"es":"Añadimos el tomate triturado, removemos y colocamos encima el bacalao, añadimos un poco de pimienta y aceite en spray, programamos 180ºC durante 12 minutos.","en":"Add the crushed tomato, stir, and place the cod on top, add a little pepper and spray oil, and set to 180 °C for 12 minutes."},"timerMinutes":12,"temperatureC":180},{"text":{"es":"Servimos.","en":"Serve."}}]}